# On the Job: "Creatures you control get +2/+1 until end of turn. Investigate." (CR 611.2c, 701.16a). Bot1's Memnite and Bot2's
# Memnite are on the battlefield on turn 3. Bot1 attacks with its Memnite, then casts On the Job ({2}{W}{W}: Black Lotus for
# white and Mox Pearl): its Memnite becomes 3/2 (both halves checked) and Bot2's stays 1/1 ("you control"), and Bot1 gets one Clue.
# Bot1's Phyrexian Walker, which stayed home, is pumped too (2/4), while the Ornithopter cast in the second main phase (entering
# after resolution) is not: it stays 0/2. Combat damage is 3 (Bot2 20 to 17). On turn 4 Bot1's Memnite is 1/1 again. Bot2 gets no Clue.

